Error: Jet.EffectWithoutAuthority: `authority` doesn't hold `FS.Write`, so `with` can't narrow to it
  --> Tests/UI/Effects/authority_with_outside_held_rights_is_e0712.jet:3:23
    |
  3 |     _: authority.with("FS.Write")
    |                       ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `authority` holds `FS.Read("repo")` and `FS.Write(".jet/build")`, from `Authority.workspace()` on line 2; a scoped right never covers the bare one
 Fix: Ask for a right `authority` holds, such as `FS.Write(".jet/build")`, or build the authority with `FS.Write`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.EffectWithoutAuthority
